      "edit": "A client error Node reports for the request it is still receiving (request.complete is false: a bad chunk size, a body cut by the request timeout or by the client FIN) is answered at once after the requests BEFORE it; the refusal no longer waits for that request own lane entry (a body that cannot end). A request that Node never finished receiving is dropped after its own turn, so it never answers twice. A complete request still waits for its own answer."
    },
